// §0 Page metadata — title tag and description both drafted in full.
//
// The description is NEW copy this revision. It replaces "Regular house
// cleaning from local mums you actually know. Same cleaner every visit,
// police checked and insured." — this brief drops both the "local mums"
// framing and the police-checked/insured claim, so neither survives here.
